  "why": [
    "The setup-gated standard-FTMS Life Fitness variant had no archived GATT inventory; only the",
    "Discover SE variant (issue #3374) did. This is the discovery the #1018 client actually",
    "performed, reassembled from the capture's ATT layer.",
    "Its load-bearing fact is an ABSENCE: service 0x1826 contains no 0x2AD9 Fitness Machine Control",
    "Point and none of 0x2AD4-0x2AD8 supported-range characteristics. Plan section 6c.0 keeps the",
    "Life Fitness control path unreachable on the untestable-family rule; this is the first direct",
    "observation that the machine offers no control surface to reach."
